    <label xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="doc_jnl_type" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/documentation" xml:lang="en">Type of sub-account - profit center, division, business unit, fund, program, branch, project, class, su-class or other modifier is placed here. For example:: Accountability center: Business unit: Class:Department: Project: Fund: Program:Job: Profit center: Branch: Setup class: Division: Unit</label>
    <labelArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/concept-label" xlink:from="loc_jnl_type" xlink:to="doc_jnl_type"/>
